\cb3         content: \cf9 \strokec9 `Growing up with roots in Bhavnagar, Gujarat gave me a strong appreciation for culture, community, and heritage. Bhavnagar taught me humility, dedication, and the value of perseverance.\\n\\nMoving my educational journey forward in Surat\'97the dynamic 'Diamond City' of Gujarat\'97has been a transformative leap. Surat is fast-paced, full of entrepreneurial spirit, and buzzing with tech aspirants. Balancing my roots from Bhavnagar with the modern dynamism of Surat has shaped how I view technology, architecture, and web applications. Every line of code I craft reflects that blend of steady traditions and innovative ambition.`\cf0 \strokec5 ,\cb1 \
